{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 2, "ref": "judges 18:2", "book": "judges", "lang": "om", "chapter": 18, "translation": "Ilmaan Daanitis maatiin isaanii keessaa namoota shan, dheebuna isaanii keessaa — namoota humna qaban — Tsoraa fi Eshta'ool irraa, ⟨את⟩ dachii yaadachuufi qorachuuf ergani. Isaanis isaaniif jedhan: 'Ada'i, ⟨את⟩ dachii qoradhaa.' Isaanis gara gaarii Efiraayim, mana Miikaatti dhufan, achittis halkan turan.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וישלחו", "gloss": "ergan"}, {"surface": "בני", "gloss": "ilmaan"}, {"surface": "דן", "gloss": "Daanitis"}, {"surface": "ממשפחתם", "gloss": "maatiin isaanii keessaa"}, {"surface": "חמשה", "gloss": "shan"}, {"surface": "אנשים", "gloss": "namoota"}, {"surface": "מקצותם", "gloss": "dheebuna isaanii keessaa"}, {"surface": "אנשים", "gloss": "namoota"}, {"surface": "בני", "gloss": "ilmaan"}, {"surface": "חיל", "gloss": "humna"}, {"surface": "מצרעה", "gloss": "Tsoraa"}, {"surface": "ומאשתאל", "gloss": "Eshta'ooliinis"}, {"surface": "לרגל", "gloss": "yaadachuuf"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "dachii"}, {"surface": "הארץ", "gloss": "dachii"}, {"surface": "ולחקרה", "gloss": "qorachuufis"}, {"surface": "ויאמרו", "gloss": "isaanis jedhan"}, {"surface": "אלהם", "gloss": "isaaniif"}, {"surface": "לכו", "gloss": "Ada'i"}, {"surface": "חקרו", "gloss": "qoradhaa"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "dachii"}, {"surface": "הארץ", "gloss": "dachii"}, {"surface": "ויבאו", "gloss": "dhufan"}, {"surface": "הר", "gloss": "gaarii"}, {"surface": "אפרים", "gloss": "Efiraayim"}, {"surface": "עד", "gloss": "gara"}, {"surface": "בית", "gloss": "mana"}, {"surface": "מיכה", "gloss": "Miikaa"}, {"surface": "וילינו", "gloss": "halkan turan"}, {"surface": "שם", "gloss": "achittis"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-29T07:14:18.077578048Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}